        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-hero-content">
                <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
                <h1>Neighbors helping neighbors since 1935.</h1>
                <p>
                    For more than 90 years, the Skowhegan Lions Club has
                    brought people together through service, generosity,
                    and a commitment to our community.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- History Highlights -->
    <section class="about-highlights">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-stats">

                <div class="about-stat">
                    <span class="stat-number">1935</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Year Founded</span>
                </div>

                <div class="about-stat">
                    <span class="stat-number">6</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">District Governors Supported</span>
                </div>

                <div class="about-stat">
                    <span class="stat-number">31</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Melvin Jones Fellows</span>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Who We Are -->
    <section class="about-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-two-column">

                <div class="about-copy">
                    <span class="section-eyebrow">Who We Are</span>

                    <h2>A tradition of service in Skowhegan</h2>

                    <p>
                        Since its founding in 1935, the Skowhegan Lions Club
                        has built a proud tradition of community involvement
                        and volunteer service.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Our members give their time and energy to help
                        neighbors, support local organizations, and make
                        a positive difference throughout the Skowhegan area.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        We are a local club with a worldwide connection,
                        proudly serving as part of Lions Clubs International.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="about-image-placeholder">
                    <div class="about-image-caption">
                        <span>Skowhegan Lions Club</span>
                        <strong>Serving our community for generations</strong>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Service -->
    <section class="about-service">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="about-section-heading">
                <span class="section-eyebrow">What Matters to Us</span>
                <h2>Making a difference close to home</h2>
                <p>
                    We believe strong communities are built when people
                    come together to help one another.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-service-grid">

                <article class="about-service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">◎</div>
                    <h3>Vision Assistance</h3>
                    <p>
                        We help local residents with the cost of eyeglasses,
                        continuing the Lions tradition of helping people
                        protect and improve their sight.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="about-service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">✦</div>
                    <h3>Education &amp; Scholarships</h3>
                    <p>
                        Our fundraising supports scholarships for graduating
                        high school seniors and helps create educational
                        opportunities for young people.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="about-service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">♡</div>
                    <h3>Community Service</h3>
                    <p>
                        From local events and fundraisers to supporting
                        community organizations, our members are involved
                        throughout the year.
                    </p>
                </article>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Recognition -->
    <section class="about-recognition">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-two-column">

                <div>
                    <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Legacy</span>
                    <h2>Leadership, dedication, and service</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="about-copy">
                    <p>
                        Throughout our history, the Skowhegan Lions Club
                        has supported five District Governors and is proud
                        to count 18 Melvin Jones Fellows among its members
                        and honorees.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Our club was also recognized as a Campaign SightFirst
                        II Model Club during 2007–2008. These achievements
                        reflect the dedication of generations of Lions who
                        have supported our mission.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Lions International -->
    <section class="about-international">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="international-content">

                <span class="section-eyebrow">Part of Something Bigger</span>

                <h2>We Serve.</h2>

                <p>
                    The Skowhegan Lions Club is part of Lions Clubs
                    International, a worldwide network of volunteers
                    dedicated to serving their communities and improving lives.
                </p>

                <a
                    href="https://www.lionsclubs.org/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="btn btn-outline-light">
                    Discover Lions International
                </a>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Membership Invitation -->
    <section class="about-cta">
        <div class="container">

            <span class="section-eyebrow">Get Involved</span>

            <h2>Make a difference in your community.</h2>

            <p>
